      {
        "id": 265091,
        "name": "",
        "username": "LonelyMan",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2026-02-13T19:01:01.553Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Welcome to the Letters Page, with your hosts, Adam and Wager Master.  I am so glad that was a bit.</p>\n<p>I weirdly love Adam’s defense of the candy hearts, a fondness which I definitely do not share.</p>\n<p>Guise and extremeverse Uh Yeah kid…accidentally they recreated Firefist from the second Deadpool movie.</p>\n<p>Never a Wolverine, only an entire universe of Wolverhamptons.</p>\n<p>I’m extremely glad Brianna Lawhawke did make the cover.  I never would have guessed that she would have that suit or that hair, but they’re soooo good now that I see them.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\" data-post=\"4\" data-topic=\"30708\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Oh man, now I want a Beauty and the Beast-type story with Man-Grove. &gt;_&gt;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>“Tale as old as vine, branch and hand entwine, beauty and the leaf.”</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"FrivYeti\" data-post=\"13\" data-topic=\"30708\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/48/1919_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> FrivYeti:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Brianna hires the heroes to catch the real villain while she defends him in court.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Can a lawyer defend someone in court whom they’re dating?  I’d think that would be a obvious conflict of interest.</p>",
        "post_number": 25,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2026-02-13T21:21:34.919Z",
        "reply_count": 1,
